As long as your primary weapon is highly enchanted it
does not have to matter which artifact it is.  Some monsters
will be immune to the specialist ones, no monster will be
immune to the generalist ones, even Grayswandir ends up
getting viewed as one of the specialist ones with respect
to silver damage.  So if you don't care about losing potions
go with Frost brand.  It works well in G where most monsters
are fire resistant and few are cold resistant.  Then on the
planes where host and cold resistance are reversed, there
still are no monsters immune to the +6 enchantment of any
weapon.

